(For centuries, philosophical and scientific orthodoxy maintained that high-order reasoning and abstract) Tj
0 -14 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(problem solving were exclusive evolutionary attributes of the human species. Early ethologists classified non-human) Tj
0 -14 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(creatures as biological automatons, governed strictly by genetic hardwiring, basic instinct, and conditioned reflexes.) Tj
0 -14 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(Over the past quarter-century, however, cognitive ethology has undergone a profound revolution. Experimental) Tj
0 -14 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(breakthroughs spanning diverse taxa demonstrate that animals engage in causal reasoning, episodic memory recall,) Tj
0 -14 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(and future planning that challenge our traditional anthropocentric paradigms.) Tj
0 -14 Td
