(In a famous field study off the coast of Indonesia, researchers documented veined octopuses collecting discarded) Tj
0 -14 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(coconut shell halves from the seabed. The cephalopods transported these clumsy shells beneath their bodies across open sand,) Tj
0 -14 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(subsequently stacking and assembling them into an armored spherical sanctuary when threatened by predators.) Tj
0 -14 Td
/F1 10 Tf
